  "cornerRule": {
    "note": "Spa's official numbering counts the Eau Rouge left (about 17 degrees of turn) and splits Pouhon (turns 10 and 11) and Campus and Stavelot (turns 14 and 15), which the default rule merges or drops. A higher entry threshold, a 30 m merge gap and a 15 degree minimum find exactly the 19 official corners in order.",
